                introHeader: "Introduction: The Syntropix Executive Leadership Index",
                introBody: `<p>The Executive Leadership Index is Syntropix's flagship instrument — the most comprehensive assessment we build, and a broad developmental self-report designed to structure reflection across ten research-informed leadership dimensions. Where our other assessments each measure one specific, well-defined capability, this one measures ten, spanning task-oriented execution, how you actually develop and protect the people who work for you, your ability to lead real change rather than just adapt to it yourself, your influence and network beyond your own team, and your composure and decision quality exactly when the pressure is highest.</p>
                            <p>This isn't ten narrow assessments stapled together. It's a single, purpose-built developmental instrument informed by established research traditions in leadership behaviour, emotional regulation under pressure, team dynamics and social capital. Those external literatures inform construct design; they do not by themselves establish reliability, validity, norms or predictive performance for this Syntropix instrument. Every one of the 200 questions in this assessment was written specifically for Syntropix — none are adapted from any published instrument.</p>
                            <p>This is the longer, approximately 90-minute version, intended for deeper leadership-development reflection. It is not established here as a standalone predictor of job performance or as a selection, promotion or succession instrument.</p>`,
